I'll create a pixel-perfect Space Invaders arcade game that replicates the original 1978 Taito experience with authentic sprites, mechanics, and rules.
```html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>SPACE INVADERS · 1978 Taito</title>
    <style>
        /* CRT scanline overlay + retro aesthetic */
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }
        body {
            background: #000;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            min-height: 100vh;
            font-family: 'Courier New', monospace;
            image-rendering: pixelated;
        }
        .cabinet {
            background: #111;
            border: 6px solid #333;
            border-radius: 20px;
            padding: 20px 30px 30px;
            box-shadow: 0 0 30px rgba(0,255,0,0.2), inset 0 0 20px #000;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            align-items: center;
        }
        .screen-wrapper {
            position: relative;
            background: #000;
            border: 4px solid #222;
            border-radius: 8px;
            padding: 4px;
            box-shadow: inset 0 0 10px #0f0, 0 0 0 2px #0a0a0a;
        }
        canvas {
            display: block;
            background: #0a0a0a;
            width: 640px;
            height: 640px;
            image-rendering: pixelated;
            box-shadow: inset 0 0 40px #0f0;
        }
        /* scanline effect */
        .screen-wrapper::after {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            top: 0; left: 0;
            width: 100%; height: 100%;
            background: repeating-linear-gradient(0deg, rgba(0,0,0,0.15) 0px, rgba(0,0,0,0.15) 2px, transparent 2px, transparent 4px);
            pointer-events: none;
            border-radius: 4px;
        }
        .controls {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            width: 100%;
            margin-top: 20px;
            gap: 20px;
        }
        .btn {
            background: #222;
            border: 3px solid #555;
            border-radius: 10px;
            color: #0f0;
            font-size: 1.2rem;
            font-weight: bold;
            padding: 10px 20px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 2px;
            cursor: pointer;
            box-shadow: 0 0 10px #0f0;
            transition: 0.1s;
        }
        .btn:active {
            background: #0f0;
            color: #000;
            transform: scale(0.95);
        }
        .info {
            color: #0f0;
            font-size: 1.1rem;
            text-shadow: 0 0 6px #0f0;
            display: flex;
            gap: 30px;
            align-items: center;
        }
        .info span {
            background: #000;
            padding: 4px 12px;
            border: 1px solid #0f0;
            border-radius: 4px;
        }
        @media (max-width: 720px) {
            canvas { width: 360px; height: 360px; }
            .cabinet { padding: 10px; }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="cabinet">
    <div class="screen-wrapper">
        <canvas id="gameCanvas" width="640" height="640"></canvas>
    </div>
    <div class="controls">
        <div class="info">
            <span id="scoreDisplay">0000</span>
            <span id="livesDisplay">❤️❤️❤️</span>
        </div>
        <div>
            <button class="btn" id="resetBtn">⟲ RESET</button>
        </div>
    </div>
    <div style="color:#0f0; font-size:0.8rem
